sequenceDiagram
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>openshift-monitoring
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Upstream as Upstream Metrics<br/>8081/TCP HTTP localhost

    Note over Prometheus,Upstream: Flow 1: Authenticated Metrics Scrape

    Prometheus->>Proxy: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token<br/>(ServiceAccount Token)
    Proxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview Response<br/>(authenticated identity)

    alt prometheus-k8s SA (hardcoded allow)
        Note over Proxy: Hardcoded authorizer:<br/>system:serviceaccount:<br/>openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s<br/>→ GET /metrics always allowed
    else Other identity
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA Token
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: SAR Response<br/>(allowed/denied)
    end

    Proxy->>Upstream: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP localhost:8081<br/>No auth (trusted localhost)
    Upstream-->>Proxy: Metrics Response
    Proxy-->>Prometheus: Metrics Response<br/>HTTPS/8443

    Note over Prometheus,Upstream: Flow 2: Format2 Endpoint Authorization (e.g., TrustyAI)

    participant Client as Client
    participant Proxy2 as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI2 as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TrustyAI as Upstream Service<br/>configurable/TCP HTTP

    Client->>Proxy2: POST /api/v1/explain<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token<br/>X-Tenant: my-namespace
    Proxy2->>K8sAPI2: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI2-->>Proxy2: Authenticated identity
    Note over Proxy2: Format2 path match:<br/>/api/v1/explain → POST rule<br/>namespace from X-Tenant header template
    Proxy2->>K8sAPI2: SubjectAccessReview<br/>resource: trustyai.opendatahub.io<br/>namespace: my-namespace
    K8sAPI2-->>Proxy2: SAR allowed
    Proxy2->>TrustyAI: POST /api/v1/explain<br/>HTTP localhost<br/>x-remote-user, x-remote-groups headers
    TrustyAI-->>Proxy2: Response
    Proxy2-->>Client: Response<br/>HTTPS/8443
